Subject: [PATCH] RomCore embedding: SHIP_HOME on Android, embed API (events,
 pause, ready), no menu toggle when embedded, SDL2 Java package relocation
 patch

---
 cmake/dependencies/android.cmake              |  1 +
 .../patches/romcore-sdl2-java-package.cmake   | 11 +++
 include/ship/port/mobile/MobileImpl.h         |  9 +++
 src/ship/Context.cpp                          | 12 ++++
 src/ship/port/mobile/MobileImpl.cpp           | 71 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/ship/window/gui/Gui.cpp                   |  3 +-
 6 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
